<title>USA: Brooks Fiber in pact with Nevada Bell.</title>
<headline>Brooks Fiber in pact with Nevada Bell.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brooks Fiber Properties Inc said Friday it entered into an interconnection agreement with Nevada Bell, a subsidiary of Pacific Telesis Group.</p>
<p>Brooks Fiber said the agreement would enable a subsidiary, Brooks Fiber Communications of Nevada Inc, to begin providing local exchange services to residential and business customers throughout Nevada Bell's service areas in Reno, Nevada.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
